#X restore 220 1050 pd parameters;
#X text 220 1084 every control, f 22;
#N canvas 0 50 1300 1516 messages 0;
#X text 30 16 click any box to send it to the synth. the synth receives everything through its name so you can use [s sh101] from anywhere in your patch, f 110;
#X msg 30 66 \; sh101 note 60 100;
#X text 334 68 play midi note 60 at velocity 100 (velocity 0 is note off);
#X msg 30 120 \; sh101 note 60 0;
#X text 334 122 release note 60;
#X msg 30 174 \; sh101 bend 0.5;
#X text 334 176 pitch bend from -1 to 1 (size set by bendrange);
#X msg 30 228 \; sh101 bendrange 12;
#X text 334 230 bend range in semitones (default 2);
#X msg 30 282 \; sh101 mod 0.5;
#X text 334 284 mod wheel from 0 to 1 (more lfo);
#X msg 30 336 \; sh101 aftertouch 0.5;
#X text 334 338 channel pressure from 0 to 1 (opens the filter);
#X msg 30 390 \; sh101 sustain 1;
#X text 334 392 sustain pedal (1 down and 0 up);
#X msg 30 444 \; sh101 panic;
#X text 334 446 silence everything immediately;
#X msg 30 498 \; sh101 set cutoff 0.3;
#X text 334 500 set one parameter by name (see the parameters page);
#X msg 30 552 \; sh101 params;
#X text 334 554 print every parameter name to the pd window;
#X msg 30 606 \; sh101 preset 3;
#X text 334 608 load preset number 3 (counting from 0);
#X msg 30 660 \; sh101 next;
#X text 334 662 next preset (wraps around);
#X msg 30 714 \; sh101 prev;
#X text 334 716 previous preset;
#X msg 30 768 \; sh101 mutate 0.3;
#X text 334 770 random variation of the current sound from 0 to 1;
#X msg 30 822 \; sh101 A;
#X text 334 824 remember the current sound as a;
#X msg 30 876 \; sh101 B;
#X text 334 878 remember the current sound as b;
#X msg 30 930 \; sh101 morph 0.5;
#X text 334 932 blend between a and b;
#X msg 30 984 \; sh101 store mysound;
#X text 334 986 keep the current sound in the user bank after the factory presets;
#X msg 30 1038 \; sh101 save my.bank;
#X text 334 1040 write the user bank to a text file next to this patch;
#X msg 30 1092 \; sh101 load my.bank;
#X text 334 1094 add the presets from a text file to the user bank;
#X msg 30 1146 \; sh101 data 0.5;
#X text 334 1148 data inlet: any number from 0 to 1 (a sensor or a csv column) that drives mapped parameters;
#X msg 30 1200 \; sh101 datamap cutoff 0.3;
#X text 334 1202 map data to a parameter: it moves up to 0.3 either side (a negative amount inverts);
#X msg 30 1254 \; sh101 datamap clear;
#X text 334 1256 remove all data mappings (up to four at once);
#X text 30 1322 --- outlets of the object ---;
#X text 30 1366 outlet 1 audio left   outlet 2 audio right   outlet 3 preset name as a symbol   outlet 4 list with preset index and preset count, f 110;
#X text 30 1416 create it as [sh101~]  or  [sh101~ name]  or  [sh101~ name 8]   where name is the prefix used by every box and 8 is the voice count, f 110;
#X restore 410 1050 pd messages;
#X text 410 1084 clickable list, f 22;
